               <p xml:id="idm130">Rosing's song was published anonymously in "Nogle Smaadigte af en Student" (Some Small Poems by a Student) in 1859. Hartmann sat music to four other poems from this collection: "Solnedgang" (HartW 397); "Vaarsang" (HartW 404); "Vaarsang" (HartW 405); and "Klage" (HartW 407).</p>
